      <g:title>Vitamin D3 + K2 Drops, 50 ml</g:title>
      <g:description>Vitamin D3 + K2 food supplement drops, 50 ml (about 1,000 drops). Per daily dose (1 drop): vitamin D3 25 µg (1,000 IU, 500% NRV); vitamin K2 (menaquinone-7, all-trans) 20 µg (27% NRV). Ingredients: medium-chain triglycerides from coconut oil (96.5%), cholecalciferol (2.5%), menaquinone-7 (1%). Suggested use: take 1 drop daily. Do not exceed the recommended daily dose. Food supplements are not a substitute for a varied and balanced diet and a healthy lifestyle. Keep out of the reach of children. Store closed, dry, cool and protected from light. Lithuanian label and company details are on the pack. Batch number and best-before date: see bottom of the bottle.</g:description>
